---
// src/components/proyectos/ProjectsStatutoryFramework.astro
---

<section
  class="projects-statutory-framework"
  aria-labelledby="statutory-framework-title"
>
  <div class="framework-content">
    <h3 id="statutory-framework-title" class="framework-title">
      Marco Estatutario de Ejecución y Planificación Regional
    </h3>
    <p class="framework-desc">
      Conforme al Art. 6 de los Estatutos publicados en La Gaceta N.° 108, los
      proyectos se estructuran bajo el Programa PICC y son ejecutados
      técnicamente por la UGP en coordinación directa con los concejos
      municipales.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="statute-badge" aria-label="Referencia estatutaria: Artículo 6">
    <span class="badge-text">Art. 6 Estatutos</span>
    <span class="badge-emoji" aria-hidden="true">
      📜
    </span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .projects-statutory-framework {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 0.875rem; /* 14px */
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-block-end: 2.5rem;
  }

  .framework-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    max-inline-size: 56.25rem; /* 900px */
  }

  .framework-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body, Inter, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1rem; /* 16px */
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #0b2538;
  }

  .framework-desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body, Inter, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.9375rem; /* 15px */
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #435362;
  }

  .statute-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
    background-color: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid #0470a0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem; /* 8px */
    color: #0470a0;
    font-family: var(--font-body, Inter, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.7188rem; /* 11.5px */
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (width <= 48rem) {
    .projects-statutory-framework {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .framework-title {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
    }

    .framework-desc {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    .statute-badge {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
  }
</style>
